{"videoId":"OD_EZv_XJ4k","title":"Đề luyện nghe N4 · Bài 09","sentenceVersion":"2026-10-04-v1","cues":[{"id":"sentence-0","text":"日本語能力試験長これからN4の聴会試験を始めます。","start":4.24,"end":18.16,"readings":[{"word":"日本語","reading":"にほんご","offset":0},{"word":"能力","reading":"のうりょく","offset":3},{"word":"試験","reading":"しけん","offset":5},{"word":"長","reading":"ちょう","offset":7},{"word":"会","reading":"かい","offset":16},{"word":"試験","reading":"しけん","offset":17},{"word":"始め","reading":"はじめ","offset":20}]},{"id":"sentence-1","text":"問題1問題1ではまず聞いてください。","start":21.72,"end":30.48,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-2","text":"それから話を聞いて問題用紙の1から4の中から1番いいものを1つ選んでください","start":30.48,"end":43.6,"readings":[{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":4},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":6},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":9},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":11},{"word":"中","reading":"なか","offset":19},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":23},{"word":"選ん","reading":"えらん","offset":31}]},{"id":"sentence-3","text":"1番警察官が話手は最後に何をしますか?","start":47.6,"end":54.001,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"警察官","reading":"けいさつかん","offset":2},{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":6},{"word":"手","reading":"しゅ","offset":7},{"word":"最後","reading":"さいご","offset":9},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-4","text":"あ、危ない。","start":54.001,"end":56.022,"readings":[{"word":"危ない","reading":"あぶない","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-5","text":"おい、止まれ。","start":56.022,"end":58.38,"readings":[{"word":"止まれ","reading":"とまれ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-6","text":"赤信号が見えなかったのか。","start":58.38,"end":62.76,"readings":[{"word":"赤信号","reading":"あかしんごう","offset":0},{"word":"見え","reading":"みえ","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-7","text":"免許証を見せなさい。","start":62.76,"end":65.656,"readings":[{"word":"免許","reading":"めんきょ","offset":0},{"word":"証","reading":"しょう","offset":2},{"word":"見せ","reading":"みせ","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-8","text":"学生さんか。","start":65.656,"end":67.394,"readings":[{"word":"学生","reading":"がくせい","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-9","text":"教習所の教官が教えてくれなかったの?","start":67.394,"end":72.606,"readings":[{"word":"教習所","reading":"きょうしゅうじょ","offset":0},{"word":"教官","reading":"きょうかん","offset":4},{"word":"教え","reading":"おしえ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-10","text":"道の左側へ車を止めて降りなさい。","start":72.606,"end":77.24,"readings":[{"word":"道","reading":"みち","offset":0},{"word":"左側","reading":"ひだりがわ","offset":2},{"word":"車","reading":"くるま","offset":5},{"word":"止め","reading":"とめ","offset":7},{"word":"降り","reading":"ふり","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-11","text":"運転手は最後に何をしますか?","start":80.159,"end":85.96,"readings":[{"word":"運転","reading":"うんてん","offset":0},{"word":"手","reading":"しゅ","offset":2},{"word":"最後","reading":"さいご","offset":4},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-12","text":"2番男の子とお母さんが話子はどうしますか?","start":99.2,"end":104.906,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":2},{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":6},{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":11},{"word":"子","reading":"こ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-13","text":"お母さん何が欲しいんだけど自分で撮って。","start":104.906,"end":110.341,"readings":[{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":4},{"word":"欲しい","reading":"ほしい","offset":6},{"word":"自分","reading":"じぶん","offset":13},{"word":"撮っ","reading":"とっ","offset":16}]},{"id":"sentence-14","text":"お母さんは今食事の準備で忙しいの。","start":110.341,"end":114.96,"readings":[{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":0},{"word":"今","reading":"こん","offset":5},{"word":"食事","reading":"しょくじ","offset":6},{"word":"準備","reading":"じゅんび","offset":9},{"word":"忙しい","reading":"いそがしい","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-15","text":"でも僕の手は短くて椅子の上に上がったら男の子はどうしますか","start":117.56,"end":124.039,"readings":[{"word":"僕","reading":"ぼく","offset":2},{"word":"手","reading":"て","offset":4},{"word":"短く","reading":"みじかく","offset":6},{"word":"椅子","reading":"いす","offset":9},{"word":"上","reading":"うえ","offset":12},{"word":"上がっ","reading":"あがっ","offset":14},{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":19}]},{"id":"sentence-16","text":"3番男の人と女の人が話しています。","start":148.16,"end":152.72,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-17","text":"男の人は寝る前につも何をしますか?","start":154.2,"end":157.2,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"寝る","reading":"ねる","offset":4},{"word":"前","reading":"まえ","offset":6},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-18","text":"家に帰って食事してお風呂に入るとゆっくりしますね。","start":159.28,"end":161.066,"readings":[{"word":"家","reading":"いえ","offset":0},{"word":"帰っ","reading":"かえっ","offset":2},{"word":"食事","reading":"しょくじ","offset":5},{"word":"風呂","reading":"ふろ","offset":10},{"word":"入る","reading":"はいる","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-19","text":"お風呂は食事の前ですか?","start":161.066,"end":161.923,"readings":[{"word":"風呂","reading":"ふろ","offset":1},{"word":"食事","reading":"しょくじ","offset":4},{"word":"前","reading":"まえ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-20","text":"後ですか?","start":161.923,"end":162.28,"readings":[{"word":"後","reading":"ご","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-21","text":"後です。","start":168.72,"end":169.2,"readings":[{"word":"後","reading":"ご","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-22","text":"その後ゆっくりビールを飲むこともあります。","start":169.2,"end":171.72,"readings":[{"word":"その後","reading":"そのご","offset":0},{"word":"飲む","reading":"のむ","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-23","text":"いいですね。","start":173.48,"end":174.123,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-24","text":"寝る前にビールですか?","start":174.123,"end":175.301,"readings":[{"word":"寝る","reading":"ねる","offset":0},{"word":"前","reading":"まえ","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-25","text":"テレビは見ないですか?","start":175.301,"end":176.48,"readings":[{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-26","text":"たまには見ますよ。","start":179.159,"end":181.159,"readings":[{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-27","text":"でも必ず日記をつけた後で布団に入ります","start":181.159,"end":188,"readings":[{"word":"必ず","reading":"かならず","offset":2},{"word":"日記","reading":"にっき","offset":4},{"word":"後","reading":"のち","offset":10},{"word":"布団","reading":"ふとん","offset":12},{"word":"入り","reading":"はいり","offset":15}]},{"id":"sentence-28","text":"男の人は寝る前にいつも何をしますか?","start":191.519,"end":198.319,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"寝る","reading":"ねる","offset":4},{"word":"前","reading":"まえ","offset":6},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-29","text":"4番男の人と女の人が話は何について話かこれどう思う?","start":211.84,"end":221.914,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":10},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":12},{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":17},{"word":"思う","reading":"おもう","offset":23}]},{"id":"sentence-30","text":"色もいいし。","start":221.914,"end":224.239,"readings":[{"word":"色","reading":"いろ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-31","text":"ちょっと太いんじゃない?","start":224.92,"end":226.12,"readings":[{"word":"太い","reading":"ふとい","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-32","text":"今は細いのを履いている人が多いわよ。","start":226.12,"end":227.92,"readings":[{"word":"今","reading":"いま","offset":0},{"word":"細い","reading":"ほそい","offset":2},{"word":"履い","reading":"はい","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":11},{"word":"多い","reading":"おおい","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-33","text":"太い方が履きやすいし、足が太いから細いのは合わないんだ。","start":230.959,"end":233.959,"readings":[{"word":"太い","reading":"ふとい","offset":0},{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":2},{"word":"履き","reading":"はき","offset":4},{"word":"足","reading":"あし","offset":11},{"word":"太い","reading":"ふとい","offset":13},{"word":"細い","reading":"ほそい","offset":17},{"word":"合わ","reading":"あわ","offset":21}]},{"id":"sentence-34","text":"そうね。","start":236.599,"end":236.942,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-35","text":"でも色はもう少し薄い方がいいわよ。","start":236.942,"end":238.399,"readings":[{"word":"色","reading":"いろ","offset":2},{"word":"もう少し","reading":"もうすこし","offset":4},{"word":"薄い","reading":"うすい","offset":8},{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-36","text":"これから温かくなるんだから。","start":238.399,"end":239.599,"readings":[{"word":"温かく","reading":"あたたかく","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-37","text":"2人は何について話していますか?","start":250.12,"end":255.879,"readings":[{"word":"人","reading":"にん","offset":1},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":3},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-38","text":"5番男の人と女の人が話しています。","start":269.32,"end":273.792,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-39","text":"2人はどれをプレゼントしますか?","start":273.792,"end":278,"readings":[{"word":"人","reading":"にん","offset":1}]},{"id":"sentence-40","text":"お母さんのプレゼント何にしましょうか?","start":278.72,"end":280.501,"readings":[{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-41","text":"飾るものがいいと思うけど。","start":280.501,"end":281.72,"readings":[{"word":"飾る","reading":"かざる","offset":0},{"word":"思う","reading":"おもう","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-42","text":"指輪なんかはどう?","start":285.039,"end":287.36,"readings":[{"word":"指輪","reading":"ゆびわ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-43","text":"そんな高いものだめよ。","start":287.36,"end":288.629,"readings":[{"word":"高い","reading":"たかい","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-44","text":"それに飾ると言ってもお部屋よ。","start":288.629,"end":290.36,"readings":[{"word":"飾る","reading":"かざる","offset":3},{"word":"言っ","reading":"いっ","offset":6},{"word":"部屋","reading":"へや","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-45","text":"そうか。","start":293.12,"end":294.293,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-46","text":"じゃあ人形とか人形はあるわ。","start":294.293,"end":298.4,"readings":[{"word":"人形","reading":"にんぎょう","offset":3},{"word":"人形","reading":"にんぎょう","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-47","text":"絵なんかはお母さんの趣味じゃないわね。","start":298.4,"end":302.919,"readings":[{"word":"絵","reading":"え","offset":0},{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":5},{"word":"趣味","reading":"しゅみ","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-48","text":"やっぱり身につけるものがいいんじゃない?","start":302.919,"end":305.919,"readings":[{"word":"身","reading":"み","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-49","text":"そうね。","start":306.28,"end":306.633,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-50","text":"寒くなるからこれにしましょう。","start":306.633,"end":307.956,"readings":[{"word":"寒く","reading":"さむく","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-51","text":"川のはお母さん持っていないし。","start":307.956,"end":309.28,"readings":[{"word":"川","reading":"かわ","offset":0},{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":3},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-52","text":"2人はどれをプレゼントしますか?","start":319.16,"end":324.84,"readings":[{"word":"人","reading":"にん","offset":1}]},{"id":"sentence-53","text":"6番女の人が友達に話しています。","start":338.319,"end":343.96,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"友達","reading":"ともだち","offset":6},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":9}]},{"id":"sentence-54","text":"女の人は本当は何歳ですか?","start":343.96,"end":346.96,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"本当は","reading":"ほんとうは","offset":4},{"word":"何","reading":"なん","offset":7},{"word":"歳","reading":"さい","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-55","text":"昨日ね、隣に引っ越してきた奥さんにね、奥さんは5つ若く見えますねって言われたのよ。","start":348,"end":355.379,"readings":[{"word":"昨日","reading":"きのう","offset":0},{"word":"隣","reading":"となり","offset":4},{"word":"引っ越し","reading":"ひっこし","offset":6},{"word":"奥さん","reading":"おくさん","offset":13},{"word":"奥さん","reading":"おくさん","offset":19},{"word":"若く","reading":"わかく","offset":25},{"word":"見え","reading":"みえ","offset":27},{"word":"言わ","reading":"いわ","offset":34}]},{"id":"sentence-56","text":"私に見られたのかしらって喜んで子供に話したのよ。","start":355.379,"end":359.699,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":0},{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":2},{"word":"喜ん","reading":"よろこん","offset":12},{"word":"子供","reading":"こども","offset":15},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":18}]},{"id":"sentence-57","text":"そしたら子供がお母さんの年","start":359.699,"end":362.039,"readings":[{"word":"子供","reading":"こども","offset":4},{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":7},{"word":"年","reading":"とし","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-58","text":"5つ多く行ったよって言うのよ。","start":367.199,"end":370.36,"readings":[{"word":"多く","reading":"おおく","offset":2},{"word":"行っ","reading":"いっ","offset":4},{"word":"言う","reading":"いう","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-59","text":"子供って何でも多い方がいいと思うらしいのよね。","start":370.56,"end":377.639,"readings":[{"word":"子供","reading":"こども","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":4},{"word":"多い","reading":"おおい","offset":7},{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":9},{"word":"思う","reading":"おもう","offset":14}]},{"id":"sentence-60","text":"女の人は本当は何歳ですか?","start":381.44,"end":387.36,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"本当は","reading":"ほんとうは","offset":4},{"word":"何","reading":"なん","offset":7},{"word":"歳","reading":"さい","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-61","text":"7番男の人と女の人がある映画について話しています。","start":400.8,"end":408.759,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"映画","reading":"えいが","offset":12},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":18}]},{"id":"sentence-62","text":"女の人はこれから誰と映画に行こうと思ってますか?","start":408.759,"end":411.759,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"誰","reading":"だれ","offset":8},{"word":"映画","reading":"えいが","offset":10},{"word":"行こ","reading":"いこ","offset":13},{"word":"思っ","reading":"おもっ","offset":17}]},{"id":"sentence-63","text":"映画どうでした?","start":414.68,"end":416.479,"readings":[{"word":"映画","reading":"えいが","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-64","text":"すごく良かったよ。","start":416.479,"end":418.28,"readings":[{"word":"良かっ","reading":"よかっ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-65","text":"人で行ったんですか?","start":418.28,"end":420.12,"readings":[{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":0},{"word":"行っ","reading":"おこなっ","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-66","text":"いえ、彼女と一緒に。","start":420.12,"end":422.36,"readings":[{"word":"彼女","reading":"かのじょ","offset":3},{"word":"一緒","reading":"いっしょ","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-67","text":"まあ、いいですね。","start":422.36,"end":424.599,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-68","text":"ご両親と一緒にどうですか?","start":424.599,"end":427.24,"readings":[{"word":"両親","reading":"りょうしん","offset":1},{"word":"一緒","reading":"いっしょ","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-69","text":"そうですね。","start":427.24,"end":428.14,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-70","text":"連れて行ってあげたいですね。","start":428.14,"end":430.24,"readings":[{"word":"連れ","reading":"つれ","offset":0},{"word":"行っ","reading":"いっ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-71","text":"女の人はこれから誰と映画に行こうと思っていますか?","start":436.319,"end":444.08,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"誰","reading":"だれ","offset":8},{"word":"映画","reading":"えいが","offset":10},{"word":"行こ","reading":"いこ","offset":13},{"word":"思っ","reading":"おもっ","offset":17}]},{"id":"sentence-72","text":"8番お店の人と女の人が話しています。","start":457.479,"end":460.847,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"店","reading":"みせ","offset":3},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":5},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":7},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":9},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-73","text":"女の人はいくら払いますか?","start":460.847,"end":463.28,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"払い","reading":"はらい","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-74","text":"奥さん、りんご安いよ。","start":466.4,"end":469.039,"readings":[{"word":"奥さん","reading":"おくさん","offset":0},{"word":"安い","reading":"やすい","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-75","text":"5個500円。","start":469.039,"end":470.42,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":1},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-76","text":"500円だよ。","start":470.42,"end":471.8,"readings":[{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-77","text":"美味しそうね。","start":471.8,"end":473.495,"readings":[{"word":"美味し","reading":"おいし","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-78","text":"でも5個もいらないわ。","start":473.495,"end":476.159,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-79","text":"1個だといくらなの?","start":476.159,"end":478.28,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":1}]},{"id":"sentence-80","text":"個だと120円。","start":478.28,"end":480.104,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":0},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-81","text":"5個だと安くなるんだよ。","start":480.104,"end":482.84,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":1},{"word":"安く","reading":"やすく","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-82","text":"じゃあ3個買うと360円。","start":482.84,"end":486.08,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":4},{"word":"買う","reading":"かう","offset":5},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-83","text":"そうね。","start":486.08,"end":486.837,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-84","text":"3個を買ってくれるなら奥さんだから30円安くするよ。","start":486.837,"end":491.759,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":1},{"word":"買っ","reading":"かっ","offset":3},{"word":"奥さん","reading":"おくさん","offset":11},{"word":"円","reading":"えん","offset":19},{"word":"安く","reading":"やすく","offset":20}]},{"id":"sentence-85","text":"じゃあ3個もらうわ。","start":491.759,"end":493.56,"readings":[{"word":"個","reading":"こ","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-86","text":"はい。","start":493.56,"end":494.56,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-87","text":"ありがとう。","start":494.56,"end":496.56,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-88","text":"女の人はいくら払いますか?","start":501,"end":506.319,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"払い","reading":"はらい","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-89","text":"問題2問題2ではまず聞いてください。","start":519.039,"end":527.519,"readings":[{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-90","text":"その後問題用紙を見てください。","start":527.519,"end":532.839,"readings":[{"word":"その後","reading":"そのご","offset":0},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":3},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":5},{"word":"見","reading":"み","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-91","text":"読む時間があります。","start":532.839,"end":536.519,"readings":[{"word":"読む","reading":"よむ","offset":0},{"word":"時間","reading":"じかん","offset":2}]},{"id":"sentence-92","text":"それから話を聞いて問題用紙の1から4の中から1番いいものを1つ選んでください","start":536.519,"end":550.16,"readings":[{"word":"話","reading":"はなし","offset":4},{"word":"聞い","reading":"きい","offset":6},{"word":"問題","reading":"もんだい","offset":9},{"word":"用紙","reading":"ようし","offset":11},{"word":"中","reading":"なか","offset":19},{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":23},{"word":"選ん","reading":"えらん","offset":31}]},{"id":"sentence-93","text":"1番男の人と女の人が話しています。","start":554.279,"end":558.48,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":2},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":6},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":8},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-94","text":"どれにしますか?","start":558.839,"end":562.839,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-95","text":"あの、4つ作りましたけど、どれがいいでしょう私は漢字がいいと思いますけど。","start":583.959,"end":591.88,"readings":[{"word":"作り","reading":"つくり","offset":5},{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":22},{"word":"漢字","reading":"かんじ","offset":24},{"word":"思い","reading":"おもい","offset":30}]},{"id":"sentence-96","text":"漢字ね。","start":592,"end":592.364,"readings":[{"word":"漢字","reading":"かんじ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-97","text":"うちは女のお客さんが多いからちょっと硬いんじゃないかしら。","start":592.364,"end":595,"readings":[{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":3},{"word":"お客","reading":"おきゃく","offset":5},{"word":"多い","reading":"おおい","offset":10},{"word":"硬い","reading":"かたい","offset":18}]},{"id":"sentence-98","text":"じゃあひらがにしましょうか。","start":599.48,"end":602.12,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-99","text":"ひらがもカタカナもちょっとね。","start":602.12,"end":603.406,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-100","text":"それよりこれの方が新しい感じがするわね。","start":603.406,"end":605.12,"readings":[{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":7},{"word":"新しい","reading":"あたらしい","offset":9},{"word":"感じ","reading":"かんじ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-101","text":"わかりました。","start":610.36,"end":611.673,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-102","text":"これにしましょう。","start":611.673,"end":613.36,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-103","text":"どれにしますか?","start":618.839,"end":621.839,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-104","text":"番。","start":636.76,"end":637.88,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-105","text":"男の人と女の人が話しています。","start":637.88,"end":640.88,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":4},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":6},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-106","text":"男の人は何のために女の人を尋ねたのですか?","start":641.72,"end":649.079,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":9},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":11},{"word":"尋ね","reading":"たずね","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-107","text":"Dさん、今お忙しいでしょうか?","start":670.2,"end":673.48,"readings":[{"word":"今","reading":"こん","offset":4},{"word":"お忙しい","reading":"おいそがしい","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-108","text":"いいえ、あまり忙しくありません。","start":673.68,"end":676.639,"readings":[{"word":"忙しく","reading":"いそがしく","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-109","text":"ちょっとお邪魔してもよろしいでしょうか?","start":676.639,"end":679.639,"readings":[{"word":"邪魔","reading":"じゃま","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-110","text":"はい、どうぞ。","start":679.8,"end":681.34,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-111","text":"遠慮なく。","start":681.34,"end":682.44,"readings":[{"word":"遠慮なく","reading":"えんりょなく","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-112","text":"あの、今度中国の上海にある視点に務めることになったんです。","start":682.44,"end":685.44,"readings":[{"word":"今度","reading":"こんど","offset":3},{"word":"中国","reading":"ちゅうごく","offset":5},{"word":"上海","reading":"しゃんはい","offset":8},{"word":"視点","reading":"してん","offset":13},{"word":"務める","reading":"つとめる","offset":16}]},{"id":"sentence-113","text":"え、そうなんですか。","start":688.56,"end":689.76,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-114","text":"上海ですか。","start":689.76,"end":690.48,"readings":[{"word":"上海","reading":"しゃんはい","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-115","text":"いいところですよ。","start":690.48,"end":691.56,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-116","text":"ええ、それでちょっとお願いがあるんですがはい。","start":694.48,"end":699.639,"readings":[{"word":"お願い","reading":"おねがい","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-117","text":"私にできることでしたら何でもおっしゃってください。","start":699.639,"end":702.639,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":0},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-118","text":"私上海は初めてですし、特に中国語が全然できませんし、ちょっと心配なんです。","start":704.32,"end":706.338,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":0},{"word":"上海","reading":"しゃんはい","offset":1},{"word":"初めて","reading":"はじめて","offset":4},{"word":"特に","reading":"とくに","offset":11},{"word":"中国","reading":"ちゅうごく","offset":13},{"word":"語","reading":"ご","offset":15},{"word":"全然","reading":"ぜんぜん","offset":17},{"word":"心配","reading":"しんぱい","offset":30}]},{"id":"sentence-119","text":"それでさんのごのいい時でいいんですが","start":706.338,"end":707.32,"readings":[{"word":"時","reading":"とき","offset":10}]},{"id":"sentence-120","text":"はい。","start":717.399,"end":718.48,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-121","text":"ちょっと中国語を教えていただけないでしょうか?","start":718.48,"end":721.48,"readings":[{"word":"中国語","reading":"ちゅうごくご","offset":4},{"word":"教え","reading":"おしえ","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-122","text":"え、私が教えるんですか?","start":722.36,"end":723.601,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":2},{"word":"教える","reading":"おしえる","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-123","text":"えっと、教えた経験もありませんが。","start":723.601,"end":725.36,"readings":[{"word":"教え","reading":"おしえ","offset":4},{"word":"経験","reading":"けいけん","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-124","text":"いえ、ただ挨拶ぐらいだけでいいんですよ。","start":729.92,"end":732.92,"readings":[{"word":"挨拶","reading":"あいさつ","offset":5}]},{"id":"sentence-125","text":"ああ、そうですか。","start":733.92,"end":735.094,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-126","text":"それなら私にもできそうです。","start":735.094,"end":736.92,"readings":[{"word":"私","reading":"わたし","offset":4}]},{"id":"sentence-127","text":"あ、やっていただけますね。","start":738.36,"end":740.68,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-128","text":"ええ、喜んでやらせていただきます。","start":740.68,"end":743.68,"readings":[{"word":"喜ん","reading":"よろこん","offset":3}]},{"id":"sentence-129","text":"ああ、よかった。","start":743.76,"end":745.023,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-130","text":"ありがとうございます。","start":745.023,"end":746.76,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-131","text":"じゃあ、今から始めましょう。","start":747.04,"end":749.68,"readings":[{"word":"今","reading":"いま","offset":4},{"word":"始め","reading":"はじめ","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-132","text":"そうですか。","start":749.68,"end":750.58,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-133","text":"はい、よろしくお願いします。","start":750.58,"end":752.68,"readings":[{"word":"お願い","reading":"おねがい","offset":7}]},{"id":"sentence-134","text":"男の人は何のために女の人を尋ねたのですか?","start":759.16,"end":766.24,"readings":[{"word":"男","reading":"おとこ","offset":0},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":2},{"word":"何","reading":"なに","offset":4},{"word":"女","reading":"おんな","offset":9},{"word":"人","reading":"ひと","offset":11},{"word":"尋ね","reading":"たずね","offset":13}]},{"id":"sentence-135","text":"3番お母さんと男の子が話しています。","start":779.8,"end":786.36,"readings":[{"word":"番","reading":"ばん","offset":1},{"word":"お母さん","reading":"おかあさん","offset":2},{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":7},{"word":"話し","reading":"はなし","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-136","text":"男の子はどのお皿を持っていきますか?","start":786.36,"end":789.36,"readings":[{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","offset":0},{"word":"皿","reading":"さら","offset":7},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":9}]},{"id":"sentence-137","text":"ちゃん、お皿持ってきてちょうだい。","start":814.36,"end":817.36,"readings":[{"word":"皿","reading":"さら","offset":5},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":6}]},{"id":"sentence-138","text":"いいよ。","start":817.44,"end":818.297,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-139","text":"で、ママ、どのお皿?","start":818.297,"end":820.44,"readings":[{"word":"皿","reading":"さら","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-140","text":"お客様が来るから大きいのがいいわね。","start":821.519,"end":824.519,"readings":[{"word":"お客様","reading":"おきゃくさま","offset":0},{"word":"来る","reading":"くる","offset":4},{"word":"大きい","reading":"おおきい","offset":8}]},{"id":"sentence-141","text":"えっと、でも四角いのと丸いのがあるよ、ママ。","start":825.8,"end":828.8,"readings":[{"word":"四角い","reading":"しかくい","offset":6},{"word":"丸い","reading":"まるい","offset":11}]},{"id":"sentence-142","text":"そうね。","start":832.04,"end":832.585,"readings":[]},{"id":"sentence-143","text":"丸くて絵の描いてない方を持ってきて。","start":832.585,"end":835.04,"readings":[{"word":"丸く","reading":"まるく","offset":0},{"word":"絵","reading":"え","offset":3},{"word":"描い","reading":"えがい","offset":5},{"word":"方","reading":"ほう","offset":10},{"word":"持っ","reading":"もっ","offset":12}]},{"id":"sentence-144","text":"分かった。","start":836.959,"end":839.959,"readings":[{"word":"分かっ","reading":"わかっ","offset":0}]},{"id":"sentence-145","text":"男の子はどのお皿を持っていきますか?","start":843.839,"end":846.839,"readings":[{"word":"男の子","reading":"おとこのこ","o